replaceMission('5.9',1,'The wrong solution claim','A claim says: “A tidal barrier stops every flood throughout a river basin.” Separate model: upstream rainfall floods homes while local drains also overflow.','Explain why the claim fails. Match warnings, drainage maintenance and temporary diversion to the model’s problems.','Flood mechanisms differ; a tidal barrier does not solve every upstream/local flood. Warnings support preparation; drainage maintenance may help local flow; diversion reduces transport disruption.');

